 "pin_regs": {
  "enable": false,
  "reason": "As rp4lp / hnx_rp4lp4 / hnx_rp4lp4x: actual RTL pin capture / launch registers (rin / bin pin flops in hnx_rp4l_pinrow / pinbeat, rout / bout launched by the hard row_e / beat_e cells, gin / gout by the gather registers, xs_* through the five-stage straps); TWO regional roots (ck_n, ck_s, lp.py landed regions), every n->s data net landed (bin_l 2,069 b, leaf-0 gather 50 b, pass-through gather 100 b). Inside each leaf ONE kept lane-front register copy feeds the shared x store; per lane the XREL operand stations (+0, d4g)."
 },
