 "job": {
  "owner": "Claude LH-P3DIE (HBM-NEXT-P3-SM)",
  "branch": "claude/lh-p3die-1019",
  "tag": "hnx_rp3lp3x",
  "purpose": "NEXT-release HBM die (OWNER 10-19 P3+(a), not a release gate): SM P = 3 matrix tile on the shared 3-lane x store hnx_xs3; CRITICAL tile hnx_rp3*: coordinator PNG review before any submit (report only).",
  "structural_change": "hnx_rp3lp3x (HBM-NEXT-P3-SM 10-19) = hnx_rp4lp4x at P = 3 (RTL hnx_rp3lp3x_flat_lp, lp.py landed regions n / s): per leaf one hnx_xs3 at the band + 3 bdc on its N face + 3 BF16 lane stacks (lanes 0 / 2 beside each other, lane 1 flat in row B nearest the store's W face) = 2 x 13 leaf hard children + the 8 rp4lp transport children, ALL on the 43.2 lattice; outline 630.72 x 2203.2 = the DIE P3 SM slot (aspect 3.5:1: two landed regional halves 630.72 x ~1,100 each, <= 1.8:1); NREL = 2 gather relays per half (+4 edges on the pass / leaf-0 gather lanes, compiler record) with FIRM stations every ~300 um; publish lane delays as ring buffers. LH-P3DIE 10-19 matched pad-return plan (1ff2abe39): rl1_s 3-edge pad = input capture register + 2-residue ring in seven 32x128 SRAMs (reach source->capture 337.8, ->SRAM 176.7, SRAM read->xs3 native-N rl1 389.6 um), bin_l landing in four dual-clock 16x546 SRAMs, xs3n child (rl1 on N), outline back to 2203.2.",
  "extra_paths": [
   "physical/common_flow/anchor_row_packing.tcl",
   "tools/hbm_next",
   "results/arch/hbm_next_1019/sm4",
   "rtl/hbm_next"
  ],
